{"code":"BL20","wikidata":"Q4921013","wikipedia":{"en":"Phetchaburi MRT station","th":"สถานีเพชรบุรี (รถไฟฟ้ามหานคร)"},"summary":{"en":"Phetchaburi MRT station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Blue Line. It is located under the junction of Asok and New Phetchaburi Road. Commuters can transfer to the Airport Rail Link at Makkasan Station, and the SRT Eastern Line at Asok Halt, located at ground level.","th":"สถานีเพชรบุรี เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าใต้ดินในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายเฉลิมรัชมงคล ที่บริเวณทางแยกอโศก-เพชรบุรี ถนนอโศก-ดินแดง กรุงเทพมหานคร เป็นสถานีเชื่อมต่อรถไฟฟ้าแอร์พอร์ต เรล ลิงก์ ที่สถานีมักกะสัน"},"opened":"2004-07-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Phetchaburi_MRT_Station_platform_level.jpg/960px-Phetchaburi_MRT_Station_platform_level.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Phetchaburi_MRT_Station_platform_level.jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/201701_Platform_1_of_Phetchaburi_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Platform_1_of_Phetchaburi_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Platform_1_of_Phetchaburi_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Concourse_level_of_Phetchaburi_MRT_Station.jpg/960px-Concourse_level_of_Phetchaburi_MRT_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Concourse_level_of_Phetchaburi_MRT_Station.jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Covid-19_vaccination_centre_at_Singh_Complex%2C_Bangkok%2C_Thailand_%2817_June_2021%29.jpg/960px-Covid-19_vaccination_centre_at_Singh_Complex%